<title>USA: CMI Corp initiates regular qtly dividend.</title>
<headline>CMI Corp initiates regular qtly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY, Okla. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>CMI Corp said Wednesday its board initiated a regular quarterly dividend of $0.01 per share, payable December 3, record November 15.</p>
<p>The manufacturer of automated equipment for the construction industry last paid $0.05 per share on December 31, 1981.</p>
<p>&quot;This (dividend) program reflects management's confidence in the outlook for our business as well as our commitment to enhance shareholders' equity,&quot; said chairman Bill Swisher in a statement.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
